#
# Counter-example for math:QuantityDimensionShape: a math:Quantity that carries no
# math:hasDimension (sh:minCount 1), so validation MUST emit
# shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent (and no other finding).
# Bound by tests/example-conformance.ttl (ex:ecQuantityUndimensioned).
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:undimensionedQuantity a math:Quantity .
